    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15f88535692e1a6dedcf4f20",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是什么轻飘飘的……\r\n算了，颜色是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec74d339f49d6db5b28021e5a3e8da0469391cdc067f266ee2a4150b8cf66de4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/71008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b913005ea51f776f0dadb45",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最重要的是设计，\r\n这点我绝不妥协。",
      "source_fingerprint": "848664cd26a1f08d0f7cf8326f5bbb976b607b44d563ca99c6d55d6341841fe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/71009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235bc6fff775925094ccfd9b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "穿着它上街便会碰上很多麻烦事。\r\n总之就是很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce24b3c73038ad4afa04ab43e66fe5e85e15e86f44c7c8f0587b0f773d04d1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/71010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23540a370d3d77474331254f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "舞步这种小事，\r\n我立刻就能记住。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca386183935fb381833b81769254e326d1a2416fc99f92c2a7be3d4c47e8f674",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/71014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c36599630d2d1b6310c6bb19",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我就是穿着这身衣服，\r\n君临于顶点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "478a6e96917dad9135c49579e73e173550b47d2fb45840be7c10a9c3ee59e3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/71015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b03c0e2ea04a9b6b096fa9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我可不是换装娃娃哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d2d94b0121ca880ecb10c5e1ef514c5e1bebcfa33a306a4ffcc20674aa08b2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/71018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72111021ad3d58d791ec63d2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要我陪你玩吗？小狗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "369a1af9dc0dd35db7556c6256b4345be3f0192bcb8b91e1acc50c280021fa6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/71019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb03d9c37487975e927f680",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "做得很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "236e525eaf465869104480728930d1a18ea575a313bfddfa361a15b518a23e56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "80000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/80000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b9f9c7322b8beed3e4270cb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你乖乖来打招呼啦，真是好孩子。\r\n……呵呵，你做到的事我都会称赞\r\n一番。这都是为了让你更听话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c078cb27ca3a7b0aaf5392307854dcdf45262bf7b4716beb9130fa84817f22a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92dcfd6f127d6df37d68728d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不靠闹钟自己起床吗……\r\n中山也很会想出这些奇怪的赌局。\r\n我是绰绰有余，但她都会输到底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6122a55014905b98b06b8d93b76fc3af64324adaa82ad09f187c4b77f94b41c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0564b23755b8e96016ed135c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中午有好好吃饭吗？自己的\r\n身体自己管理。万一倒下，\r\n我可不会用亲吻唤醒你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c134f7e9b2a2a712d9b9514ece073de286d1a57093462c8bb6affbad114683f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aede6b2b056aa6bd601aeae",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "午休要去的地方通常都已经定好了。\r\n是后辈擅自帮我挑选的。\r\n只不过她们吵吵闹闹的，很烦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "131f456b90e0c11312e44f54445a3a282ae0a13fb82f9b66310c8197bfc2920c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511366eb50b9df4d3fd8d824",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把该做的事情做完，\r\n完成明天的准备后就快去睡觉。\r\n……好好睡吧，小狗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54899419857946bc11d640913e1a7b7d65d1db6de86d8496614e16f2c23f5604",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b7e6411239e7973e1eff70",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那间撞球场的所有人也都已经臣服于\r\n我了啊……今天晚上去不知名的地方\r\n大闹一番也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6124e6b9a99518ddf7dbc60a95970c57007ee26102b2bb330d7efe6a2075580f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf50d47aeff057281cdad99",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个时期啊……会有弱小的羔羊四处\r\n游荡。那么，就让我来看看会有几人\r\n摇身变成大野狼呢……真叫人期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd1add3a55f1b3093c43254562ea67ecc4fef82c4cf442802217ebec94fbf90c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ebd21ae67aa0fe6f7f8513",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比起闷热的日本，\r\n去个国外旅行之类的还比较好。\r\n法国、意大利……都不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c531d6dc3d80b277be03b350f01eca51faebb8b079b3842269be341be711dde8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21ebeedfe2f624b2c70f6cd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来要看什么……有兴趣的\r\n论文大多看过了。我看就因应秋天\r\n……来看个诗集或纯文学吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5d227d6ff72b9d0f692e9f2f6f478053ae4b5d18246703f21de64ffaacd43be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82f6947d78a8d4b61a877ad",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仰望夜空，会立刻看见一颗最明亮的\r\n星星……那就是天狼星。直到它烙印\r\n在你的眼底前，可别移开视线啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2cab7ef7300c447934771a3555371798d02fa2c0d12f4d4a6010295d852ceec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aaf061620309518f700af76",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "90020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/90020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ece73071383e26f87e465e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曾想过有一天会在赛场上相遇。\r\n但……我所追求的不是「那个」。\r\n鲁道夫，你就由我来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28d242ea3c8a6b3465442f9c07f9b67e46d4a3b84ac6cb46192742451b5e278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ccd94b0a624d4014e6f92e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆不错，能让我学习到\r\n海外的实际体验……真是乖孩子。\r\n也不会因多余的笑话感到冷场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c2b234ed71f8bc8f71438cc67d88da120e079ca2392276f741aff9c43f964c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bfbe56216670bbe8cc83734",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高峰……是个无法轻忽的家伙。\r\n若那种人是我妹妹……不，算了。\r\n我可不能抢走阿尔丹重视的姐姐呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7631a419807ff406225369ea17a268fd38290926ed72ecfc49ea16c1c8fb94d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc49f824a3b3b4917625a97f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老爸的指导准确且没有一丝多余。\r\n同时能柔软地接纳新的价值观……\r\n凌驾于他之上就是我所能给的回礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2098848fb71a6899027ee80310642a805729d41716184b70e3b9fbb6fa36f4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71a3bb2ca971b91280566f38",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若能在世界最巅峰的竞赛中获胜，\r\n就没有人会质疑我的实力。\r\n简单明了真是太棒了……哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4e9f6fc3d2e7d41219a1ae04311f3983d8d14a75fd837bb0f6a9224cfbb11e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2819da74e33d602ded372bbd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同款的服装？这不是正好嘛！\r\n起跑冲刺时，所有人都如出一辙，\r\n因此才能凸显出我跟大家的差异啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97439da5cdf061acf82c675e03a00edc8f4129040d48f8801581b8db46736884",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6c65311d1b44c5259bebb2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "裙摆随着舞蹈摆动……\r\n正适合想展现\r\n华丽舞姿的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c915b07891626e495b34db64b8bcddfa61126e95a3c4ce934877af2b8f8f240a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4055821d55b6b5b830ab200",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到象征家就联想到鲁道夫……\r\n我会彻底刷新这些人脑里的印象。\r\n让他们知道绿色是天狼星的颜色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96bac78dfadee015aaa8abb34738a3a4a5c04560d0dab94b23149d7c959d0a41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6b01a50508855d391f1b2c8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若要进军海外，\r\n身着正装才是所谓的礼仪吧？\r\n尤其是想由现在开始支配就更该……",
      "source_fingerprint": "491faab98431e64f6071f6764333a65980a8a885a623a7cc6cfaa4105f444cdf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
