    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecaf5cbe641606a3de1e1dd1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咕……呼……啊啊？做什么？\r\n就算那么殷勤地看着我，\r\n我也不会对小狗显露敌意啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "668bda85c483fef87a1a3d536f0ba86c03a27288b54f3f2722ebc1502dafd2f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b1d54f246efefbae772680",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果睡不着，来陪我自主训练。\r\n现在可不是呆愣着的时候……\r\n我一定要变强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b62b0bb36e419ede19788dee94172d78b8607e6b7df766cf3969ccf4ca7500",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecba863f28627c54ac54478b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赏樱啊……反正你大概也\r\n很喜欢吧？要带你去看吗？\r\n看着兴奋的你好像还挺有趣的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75e41ff4b67e324e2b700a2d5a088591d9a9a6ec3f0324d5ba334ca498d4f2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc1d225df4ef367c0ca8993",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再怎么热也给我振作一点啊。\r\n要是被其他家伙看见你那丢人\r\n现眼的表情，你不会害臊吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbf0d518e6c7337e3bf449c2eeed67bd38b4c98028543e9e5a164f24bc58def5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1070/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05ad50900b0ec17f3716f5cd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你有多想要充分享用秋天的佳肴，\r\n就必须付出相同努力在体态管理上。\r\n想要我严格锻炼你也行哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "faba8c57683974619ad38c19692dd5831b28301e9a8aa3e42bb99f3190e33378",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
