    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32fcdeecff456798533d898d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，手指沾了墨水…\n呵呵，其实是和无敌他们第一次\n写信导致的…洗掉的话，有点可惜呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725d567bc3f94d35b266ffa1d3ab86c2187e2a9621999e465fba04bb53868584",
