    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:643e3924fb562866275e9988",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一起去看树吗？　\n玻璃外的星星在天上闪闪发光，\n一定很漂亮吧。",
